  "details": "I encountered many errors after updating VRChat\nWhen I start the game, it takes about 5 minutes to get there, then I need 20 minutes for my friends list and the world to show up (but not show up at all: avatar world, my favorite world ...)\nThen I need another 15 minutes to be able to join my friends\nmap for a long time, sometimes 15 minutes to 20 minutes.\nI choose a world to enter and 20 minutes later, I enter a world without anyone.\nI deleted and reloaded the game three times but it still does not work stable\nI checked in the Appdata review and found out that I was missing 1 file.\nI want to ask what I am doing wrong, and the file I lost related to the game or not.",
